{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Legend of Gandar III takes place 2 years after the events of The Legend of Gandar II and The Legend of Gandar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As people mysteriously disappear and die, including Lisa, Ben sets out to find out why. He will soon find out what has happened in the world of Gandar over the past two years. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On his journey, Ben will encounter and have to fight various monsters. Choose from more than 25 weapons to defeat your opponent. As the main character, you will learn about mysterious powers as the game progresses and be able to use them to your own advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additionally, it will feature new and epic soundtracks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adventure mode </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2D combat system </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RPG fantasy </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Additional content </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Skill leveling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u2022 Weapon upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u2022 Combat animation added</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u2022 New companions</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3566890?t=1743579354","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566890/3d92fd2ed0e560e6ecb963338531cbdeb39c0f32/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743579354","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566890/781551bed69a97be32b57401e3d41b47165a3953/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743579354","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566890/781551bed69a97be32b57401e3d41b47165a3953/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743579354","categories":[{"descript